<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine 10-yr peso bond yield exceeds global.</title>
<headline>Argentine 10-yr peso bond yield exceeds global.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's 10-year 500 million peso Eurobond launched Wednesday will yield some 170 basis points more than Argentina's global dollar bond issue due in 2006, a government source said.</p>
<p>The Eurobond was announced by Economy Minister Roque Fernando earlier Wednesday at the World Economic Forum annual meeting in Davos, Switzerland, the official said.</p>
<p>((--Patrick Adam, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0654))</p>
